This is beta release from hns-2.2-current.

***** IMPORTANT ! ******************************************
hns-2.19.6 and before contain vulnerability to spammers.
hns-2.19.8 and before contain XSS vulnerability in webif.cgi
Don't use them, please.
************************************************************

* Japanese documentation is almost completed. But no English document.
* "i system" doesn't recognize RT command and Exclusive GRP.
* Themes except 'english' and 'japanese' are not hns-2.2-current savvy.
* Only theme 'english' and 'japanese' can be used for static diary(HTML) 
 generation. 
* Template definition in Calendar was changed. You must change %day to
 %calendar_day in Calendar Templates.


See ChangeLog for the detail.


See http://yar-3.net/isystem/ for the i system details.
"i system" is a free software by yar-3 and masato-3.


If you have claims, bugs, encouragement or so, please
feel free to send us.


There are litte English documentation. If you can read
both Japanese and English, please translate the Japanese
document to English.


To install:

$ sh hns-setup.en

and answer the questions.


